  "details": "After the update. I tried log on desktop, I got some weird loading loop and got put in an error world. I tried to get back to my home world and got black screen instead. Then I tried to join on some friend in friend+ but  the join button doesn't work and the map they in were not load and I did tried to join on public world it doesn't load either. I asked a few people if they know how to fix this but no luck so far. I ran out of options is the reason why I create this post. Please let me know if anyone know how to fix this issue. Edit : I also tried fresh re-install the game doesn't work either, and verified integrity game file too",
